id: angelic-guidance
name: Angelic Guidance
talentCategory: racial
race: angel
prerequisites: Angel Race
description: >
  With your seraphic grace and wisdom, you help others reach their greatest potential.
text: >
  Angelic Guidance: With your seraphic grace and wisdom, you help others reach their greatest potential.
  –Prerequisites: Angel Race
  (1)-[Passive]: While you are adjacent to an Ally, increase that Ally’s Dodge Rolls by 1(T).
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If an adjacent Ally makes a Combat Roll, you may spend a Counter Action to increase that Combat Roll by 2(T).
  (3)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If an adjacent Ally moves, you may use the Movement Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver after that movement ends.

---

[passive]
# (1) An Ally beside you - in your Guidance Range, with Watchful Gaze: their Dodge Rolls 1(T), yours (guidance.mjs; chat.mjs).
allow guidance.dodge;
# (2) Their Combat Roll made: beside the Karmic Effects after it, a Counter Action of yours for 2(T) on it, once a Round
# (chat.mjs guidanceOptions).
allow guidance.counter;
# (3) Their Movement: on its card, the Movement Maneuver out of sequence for you - after it ends, once a Round (chat.mjs).
allow guidance.move;
